<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>General-purpose benchmarks, their evaluation metrics, the number of few-shot settings, and the primary capability they assess.</figcaption>
<div id="A5.T2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:397.5pt;height:102pt;vertical-align:-49.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-134.2pt,34.4pt) scale(0.596922784317747,0.596922784317747) ;">
<table id="A5.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A5.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A5.T2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dataset</span></td>
<td id="A5.T2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A5.T2.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Metric</span></td>
<td id="A5.T2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A5.T2.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Shot</span></td>
<td id="A5.T2.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A5.T2.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Capability Evaluated</span></td></tr>
